Orchestrion Aria
A third-party Dalamud plugin for FINAL FANTASY XIV.

FINAL FANTASY XIV is a registered trademark of Square Enix Holdings Co., Ltd.
This project is unofficial and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Square Enix Co., Ltd.

Orchestrion Aria is a fork of OrchestrionPlugin by perchbird and Meli, used under
the terms of the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Third-party packages used by this plugin, each under its own license:

- NAudio, for local MP3 and WAV playback
- FFXIVClientStructs, via the Dalamud SDK

CheapLoc and Newtonsoft.Json are provided by the Dalamud runtime and are not
redistributed by this project.

Song titles and metadata come from a community-maintained spreadsheet, credited
in the README.
